 "welcome": "",
 "Hi, I'm Fabio.<br>This is a space for you if you feel it's <b>time to slow down,</b>": "",
 "and you want to <b>feel at home</b> in your own body again.": "",
 "What I offer is breathwork and nervous system work that is practical, grounded and gentle. Together we listen to your body and use the breath to bring calm back into your system, at a pace that feels right for you. You don’t need any experience, only the wish to slow down.": "",
 "what is your body saying": "",
 "Sometimes the body <br> <b>asks us to listen.</b>": "",
 "→ You sleep 8hrs and still wake up tired.": "",
 "→ Your mind keeps going long after the day is over.": "",
 "→ Your shoulders, jaw or chest stay tight, even on calm days.": "",
 "→ You’re always busy, and you feel far from yourself.": "",
 "→ When you finally stop, something inside won’t let you rest and you feel guilty.": "",
 "Take the <span>Nervous System Assessment</span><br> and see exactly where you are": "",
 "Start with the free assessment. It takes a few minutes<br>and gives you a first picture of how you respond to stress<br>and what your body might need right now.": "",
 "<a> <span> <span>Take the FREE Assessment</span> </span> </a>": "",
 "One layer at a time": "",
 "The Breathwork Way <b>Framework</b>": "",
 "My approach is like peeling an onion: from the outside in, gently, listening to what your body is ready for.": "",
 "Regulate": "",
 "\"Can I feel calm in my body again?\"": "",
 "First we bring your system out of alert, with gentle breathing and a daily practice that gives you a way back to calm.": "",
 "Reveal": "",
 "\"Why does my body react like this?\"": "",
 "Then we listen to what the tension and the symptoms are saying, and understand the patterns behind them.": "",
 "Release": "",
 "\"Can I finally let it go?\"": "",
 "When your body feels safe, deeper breathwork lets you release what thinking alone can't reach.": "",
