 "You wake up at 3am and the mind is already working. You snap at the people closest to you, good moments pass without you being able to feel them because part of you is always waiting for something to go wrong.": "",
 "The perfectionist": "",
 "You check and correct everything, you stay involved in decisions that should not need you. Deeply you don’t trust and letting go feels unsafe. Control feels like protection, yet it’s keeping you, and your business stuck.": "",
