 "ABOUT ME | BREATHWORK FACILITATOR": "",
 "<i>Breathwork </i>as a return to presence, not an escape from reality": "",
 "My name is Fabio, a breathwork facilitator and somatic coach based in Lisbon, and I’ve been guiding nervous system regulation work for over four years. My work is grounded in <i>trauma-informed</i> practices, somatic therapy and the simple but profound recognition that our bodies hold wisdom our minds often overlook.": "",
 "I came to this work through my own journey with depression, performance pressure and the exhausting habit of living primarily in my head. <br>Breathwork gave me a way back into my body as a <b>practice of coming home.</b>": "",
 "Based in Lisbon, Portugal, I work with high-functioning professionals, entrepreneurs, creatives and anyone who appears calm on the surface but carries tension beneath. <b>People who’ve tried therapy, meditation, everything and still feel something missing.</b>": "",
 "<i>The Breathwork Way is my method!</i>": "",
 "<span>I’ve trained with leading teachers in somatic therapy, polyvagal theory and various breathwork modalities.</span><br><span>I’ve worked with hundreds of individuals and groups, from corporate executives to therapists themselves. And I continue to be a student of this work, because the breath is endlessly intelligent.</span><b></b>": "",
