 "HOW I WORK": "",
 "A structured, trauma-informed approach": "",
 "that combines conscious breathing techniques with nervous system education.<br>It’s not about transcendence or peak experiences. It’s about learning to regulate and to feel safe in stillness": "",
 "Trauma-Informed Always": "",
 "<em>Safety is the foundation.</em> <br>I create containers where your nervous system can explore without being pushed, forced, or bypassed. This work respects your pace and honors your boundaries.": "",
 "Individualized Approach": "",
 "<em>Every person is unique.</em> <br>I tailor practices to your specific patterns, history and goals. What works for one person may not work for another and that’s exactly as it should be.": "",
 "Education-Based": "",
 "I teach you about your breath and nervous system so you understand what’s happening in your body. <br>Knowledge creates agency.<br>Agency creates sustainable change": "",
 "Results-Oriented": "",
 "This isn’t spiritual bypassing or wellness theater. <br>The goal is real, embodied regulation that shows up in your actual life: <br>better sleep, less reactivity and more presence.": "",
 "Ready to work with your Breath?": "",
 "Let’s explore if breathwork and nervous system regulation are right for you.": "",
