 "who you will work with": "",
 "Hey, I'm Fabio": "",
 "For years I was a <i>structural engineer </i>and my job was to calculate loads, stress and how much a structure can carry before it cracks.": "",
 "At some point I realised I was running the same calculation on myself, and the numbers didn’t look good. Breathwork brought me back into my body and now, five years later, it’s my work.": "",
 "<strong>I still think like an engineer.</strong> I assess before I guide, I explain what’s happening in your nervous system, and I give you tools you can use on your own, long after our sessions end.": "",
